n worden wäre.', 'type': 'Unterbrechungszauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e7ca685-70f5-4e38-b721-f82c9454a410'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Deserción', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62d16eaa-aa59-4d3d-9b7b-3af1ca3a4172'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Désertion', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51e1f715-4252-4737-8438-5c3cf9c34fa6'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Diserzione', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbb2b11b-bd97-42f9-8327-e0a74ea34d59'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '奪取', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b55a27a-3cfa-40a0-8cf0-5a9b3f34e0e1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Deserção', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5eb3db7a-b155-4924-ac3f-b83b84fcfdb4'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Diamantkaleidoskop', 'text': '3, {T}: Bringe einen Plasma-Spielstein ins Spiel. Behandle diesen Spielstein wie eine 0/1 Artefaktkreatur.\\nOpfere einen Plasma-Spielstein: Erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Spiele diese Fähigkeit wie eine Manaquelle.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5556c628-75f6-42dd-ae0b-48fb0936ce1e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Calidoscopio de diamantes', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42ff647c-b9ec-4d98-ab76-bfedd7073c62'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Kaleidoscope de diamant', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b2435eb-73ba-44dc-9b05-638e7cb4d37b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Caleidoscopio di Diamanti', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e19ed513-9438-4ccd-84c2-b8dad19a72ce'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ダイアモンドの万華鏡', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryf