sche Ernte', 'text': 'Bringe X Sümpfe, die Du kontrollierst, zurück auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer: Die Höllische Ernte fügt X Schadenspunkte zu, die Du beliebig auf Kreaturen Deiner Wahl verteilen kannst.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ba426d0-6d68-449d-8d97-cb06a292a711'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cosecha infernal', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba0f51e6-ce16-455a-8ea7-4d7a285745d5'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Récolte infernale', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '733d91a9-3628-44cf-95af-355ec199d34a'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Raccolto Infernale', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27595932-9d6d-4fb5-b7f7-cfd3183f9a40'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '冥府の収穫', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4bf2bbfe-0d64-408e-9a83-70ca5351120c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Colheita Infernal', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '309d7b48-4232-4c97-a6a5-97803b387efb'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Hüter von Kookus', 'text': '{R}: Schutz vor Rot bis zum Ende des Zuges', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Goblins', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1692f70e-eec3-4e63-bc09-e14efa347b6b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Guardián de Kookus', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ec160c9-ef98-42f5-8887-66c651702e8b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Gardien de kuinous', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c44d4a5-fa59-458c-b34f-6fde5fc32e88'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Custode di Kookus', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76a9ae86-9568-4ad9-83b6-8b2c432d3cba'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'クークズの番人', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfa