sto de serpientes', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fd8e8a6-fe82-4a1e-b837-cd2cbb1bfb98'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Panier de serpents', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbc272f8-4ac1-4602-9ed1-008449f9435f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cesta di Serpenti', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '03cee238-c210-4859-a814-4bd1ea5d728b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '蛇かご', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b3d3788-d31f-4669-8139-d7d30b5eba75'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cesto de Serpentes', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7aa19ad-b2c6-4d07-b317-b4fa804e44d2'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Schleichender Schimmel', 'text': 'Zerstöre ein Artefakt, ein Land oder eine Verzauberung Deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '458f85e2-befe-421e-a134-cdcdaeabab77'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Moho reptante', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96b4be8f-bae8-4949-95c7-47329e74dab3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Moisissure rampante', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fddb4b5e-8c12-47f5-adbc-34e2cb6c1140'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Muffa Insidiosa', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee78b4d6-40a3-4e7b-9e0b-3b832c90d66c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '忍び寄るカビ', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e854089-47b0-4abf-8f40-3dd4e812d5df'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Bolor Invasor', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '595745f6-9ed8-4152-8a42-c2f243090bc3'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Schleier der Nacht', 'text': 'Jedes Mana-produzierende Land ist zusätzlich zu seinem normalen Landtyp ein Sumpf.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'daca8ac9-69f7-4466-b94a-6af94da7b8e9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Manto de la noche', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f827eb76-34f1-4a92-903c-6ffc8eb96b0d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Couvert de la nuit', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3170402-f3e2-4295-b1c1-ee36d187cd65'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Manto della Notte', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e722eae-077e-4942-b3fc-7332fb757f42'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '夜のとばり', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8aadd5d1-cff7-4f03-9616-5a0e265a8daf'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Manto da Noite', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d34ae61-228e-4192-b2c1-fd47e1d6124a'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Schleierfesseln', 'text': 'Bringe die Schleierfesseln zurück auf die Hand ihres Besitzers: Eine ungeblockte Zielkreatur fügt in diesem Zug keinen Kampfschaden zu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c8a2c890-6c61-43eb-8ea9-2d67d17c3340'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cadenas vaporosas', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0a04fb6-ab62-4301-9a6d-30cc2393c62f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Chaînes de filandres', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '083bbb7c-c5e7-4246-a700-0c616d867d14'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Catene di Filo di Ragno', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92013690-1ee7-4051-9130-90913ad9f1e1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '霊糸の鎖', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '93db702f-7636-4b2c-9c35-8dfb9458e542'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Teia Diáfana', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8459f79-68d9-44ee-b92c-654612b35a84'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Schwarze Kunst', 'text': 'Du kannst die Schwarze Kunst auch als Spontanzauber spielen. Wenn Du dies tust, begrabe sie am Ende des Zuges.\\nWenn Du die Schwarze Kunst sprichst, wähle eine Zielkreaturenkarte aus einem Friedhof. Wenn die Schwarze Kunst ins Spiel kommt, bringe diese Kreatur direkt ins Spiel, als ob sie gerade gesprochen worden wäre, und die Schwarze Kunst wird zu einer Kreaturen-verzauberung, die auf diese Kreatur zielt. Wenn die Schwarze Kunst das Spiel verlässt, begrabe diese Kreatur.', 'type': 'Verzaubere Kreatur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c04a192e-c1f6-4348-a715-c8bff9da47d0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nigromancia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c229a730-9382-4c9c-83d2-d2522751a638'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nécromancie', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2707f3bc-fabd-478b-93d2-d3b09991a45b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Necromanzia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e9d99320-e2e3-4d47-a255-b3e90928952e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'ネクロマンシー', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75ee73fc-9f19-4445-90f3-628a710dad5c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Necromancia', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '204d237d-72cc-449b-8f55-3d7c900ca462'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Schweinereiter der Goblins', 'text': 'Wenn der Schweinereiter der Goblins geblockt wird, fügt er jeder angreifenden Kreatur 2 Schadenspunkte und jeder blockenden Kreatur 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Goblins', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '236bb172-cff0-4c35-a5c3-e3c83a908cfe'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Jinete porcino trasgo', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd76a36e6-3087-4027-942a-cb3c5fb89d92'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Porchelier gobelin', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd616757-2db5-4fd1-a098-a915299557bf'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Goblin Cavalca-Porci', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58bdd64f-cfac-4618-83f2-934d20d4e3b2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '豚乗りゴブリン', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71fca2f7-e0c5-41e8-a98a-8b4366dbc043'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Goblin Jóquei de Suínos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3ed85aa1-e92f-49b6-949c-913cc6d7d869'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Sifaka', 'text': 'Der Sifaka fügt jeder Kreatur, die ein Gegner Deiner Wahl kontrolliert, 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b93a24c-dd0c-4001-afd6-eb3bffa57f90'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Simún', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6479f302-1b2e-4ea1-81ea-be2a271d9bcd'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Simoun', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4612d447-4489-4990-a1c5-23120fd9058e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Simun', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '518dfba7-e1b8-4eaf-a751-dc01461fbbf9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'サイムーン', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c4cb1b7-644f-445e-9da6-1169a91dafda'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Simum', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e85b48d2-7748-429c-97ca-a1345061e3c4'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Sisays Ring', 'text': '{T}: Erhöhe Deinen Manavorrat um zwei farblose Mana. Spiele diese Fähigkeit wie eine Manaquelle.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b4034ab6-c08e-4656-ad1d-4219491bb0cb'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Anillo de Sisay', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63b652c3-afa2-44b2-a72d-6fdcad37e84f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Anneau de Sissay', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a3ed59f6-afe8-4958-bae9-b8f2aab94fdb'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Anello di Sisay', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c498ae12-29b6-4839-98ee-f60f6fdd204f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'シッセイの指輪', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46680735-ddeb-4019-acb3-9634d17674c1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Anel de Sisay', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bad9a77e-0161-4a52-b58e-ce2cde24333d'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Smaragdamulett\', \'text\': \'Wähle eines aus: Enttappe eine bleibende Karte Deiner Wahl; zerstöre eine globale Verzauberung Deiner Wahl; oder eine Kreatur Deiner Wahl verliert ihre Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'298c72ef-e39b-4319-9b34-e3d3c103f3c9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto de esmeralda\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fe58920-e85c-41df-810e-29744ecd1062\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Charme d\'émeraude", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7459e8f0-a28d-4a91-b701-9b547b3e16c7\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Smeraldo\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d29943b-37e9-46f7-98fd-96051bb281b5\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'エメラルドの魔除け\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8471c09f-93fd-43f3-a9cb-1a5327fe6f3d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Esmeralda\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81310937-2710-4bba-9518-a73081495f72\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Solfatara', 'text': 'Ein Spieler Deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug keine Landkarte ausspielen.\\nZiehe eine Karte zu Beginn der nächsten Versorgungsphase.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b436601a-433f-4949-ad91-f1640b8c9113'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Solfatara', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '436e8a39-7120-4d84-b2ae-c4ea6d62aec3'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Solfatare', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef68d84e-80da-4455-86f8-06f88c27640c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Solfatara', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ee664c3-13c0-4e2d-80d1-2b23213802c4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '硫黄の噴気孔', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78d749c6-9c82-46a6-ad20-3f8cc7d839fb'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Solfatara', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e96ff9e-4b48-4026-b808-b17e67d1ddf6'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Sommerblüte', 'text': 'Du kannst bis zu drei zusätzliche Länder in diesem Zug ausspielen.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c1089c2-e931-40d1-a188-6456cd1f479b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Floración estival', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c34b4cb0-26cc-4f2c-8c7e-02859aecfbf8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Floraison estivale', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '585a99db-efb6-40d1-8820-798bfa2e6bb4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Fioritura Estiva', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e89f9fa0-559c-48b9-8364-5fb39ea59a68'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '花盛りの夏', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c643b3e-92a9-4a38-b159-65be05145cc9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Floração Estival', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cf56c176-2450-4b2c-8674-4df9340532b5'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Spinnenbeine\', \'text\': \'Du kannst die Spinnenbeine auch als Spontanzauber spielen. Wenn Du dies tust, begrabe sie am Ende des Zuges.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +0/+3 und kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.\', \'type\': \'Verzaubere Kreatur\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'211ff093-dfa5-4772-b605-2d53b7868295\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Naturaleza arácnida\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee5f8659-4281-4028-84c3-a544c7c79cf9\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Escalade d\'araignée", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d506156-d3b9-482c-aecf-996124485d93\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Agilità del Ragno\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b055ae24-dd6a-4290-ab1d-dcac4a4bc4bd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'蜘蛛変化\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b493fee-39cd-45cb-abd7-3ef9ba113c7e\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Escalar como Aranha\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc75e82d-e385-48e6-8824-bf5ce9399d94\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Stadt der Einsamkeit', 'text': 'Jeder Spieler kann Zaubersprüche und Fähigkeiten nur während seines Zuges sprechen bzw. benutzen.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1449f67-caf4-417d-8d12-2d5a7b43ae55'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ciudad de la Soledad', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52346ced-f619-4534-a5ec-efcb348be1e0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cité de solitude', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09925e73-bdcc-4b5c-a741-709b71bd4560'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Città della Solitudine', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f8cbd21-c7de-4926-a7d1-d7b6202ee9bd'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '孤独の都', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fca9a045-17cb-4ca9-81e2-1af103f3f23e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Cidade do Isolamento', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f505517c-3d2e-4e4c-9bdd-276180dcfdbf'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Steife Brise', 'text': 'Instabilität\\nFliegende Kreaturen können nicht angreifen, blocken oder Fähigkeiten benutzen, die Tap in ihren Aktivierungskosten erfordern.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd58f5c00-8459-4c3a-9a9f-c5b16f1cc5a9'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vientos catabáticos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eba3b3e9-24f6-4b27-9241-bc31d2b6074f'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Vents katabatiques', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'acccd34d-f315-47fb-88d2-4fa3c53c507b'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Venti Catabatici', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6d93e49-c124-42da-8d9b-37087cde05c8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '下降気流', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8da0ef0b-a651-4410-9d56-16fbb44041d2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Ventos Catabáticos', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'