original_text: ['All attacking creatures with flying get -2/-2 and lose flying until end of turn.', 'All creatures that are phased out phase in and all creatures with phasing phase out.', 'All creatures with flying able to block Talruum Piper do so.', 'All creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'All spells cost one generic mana less to play.', 'All white creatures you control gain protection from black.\\nAll black creatures you control gain protection from white.', "At the beginning of each player's upkeep, that player chooses artifacts, creatures, lands, or global enchantments. All cards of that type phase out.", "At the end of each turn, each player who tapped a land for mana during that turn sacrifices a land. If a plains is sacrificed in this way, Desolation deals 2 damage to that plains' controller.", 'Attacking does not cause Iron-Heart Chimera to tap.\\nIron-Heart Chimera counts as a Chimera.\\nSacrifice Iron-Heart Chimera: Put a +2/+2 counter on target Chimera and attacking any turn does not cause that Chimera to tap.', 'Bury all creatures with power 4 or greater.', 'Choose one Destroy target artifact creature; or all attacking creatures get +1/+0 until end of turn; or target creature with power 2 or less is unblockable this turn.', "Choose one Target artifact phases out; or put the top four cards from target player's library into his or her graveyard; or all lands of one type are basic lands of your choice until end of turn.", 'Choose one Target creature gains first strike until end of turn; or target player gains 2 life; or destroy target local enchantment.', 'Choose one Target player chooses and discards a card; or target creature gets +2/-1 until end of turn; or target creature gains swampwalk until end of turn. (If defending player controls any swamps, that creature is unblockable.)', 'Choose one Untap target permanent; or destroy target global enchantment; or target creature loses flying until end of turn.', "Coral Atoll comes into play tapped.\\nWhen Coral Atoll comes into play, return an untapped island you control to owner's hand or bury Coral Atoll.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nU and one colorless mana to your mana pool.", 'Counter target spell. If that spell is an artifact or summon spell, put that card into play under your control as though it were just played.', "Creatures do not untap during their controllers' untap phase.\\nEach nongreen creature's controller may pay an additional o2 during his or her upkeep to untap that creature.", 'Cumulative upkeep o1\\nBlack creatures cannot attack you. Nonblack creatures cannot attack you unless their controller pays an additional o2 for each attacking creature.', "Cumulative upkeep o1\\nDuring your upkeep, put a rust counter on each artifact target opponent controls. If the number of rust counters on an artifact equals or exceeds that artifact's casting cost, bury the artifact.\\nIf Corrosion leaves play, remove all rust counters from the game.", 'Cumulative upkeep o1\\nIf you play a card, bury Juju Bubble.\\no2: Gain 1 life.', 'Cumulative upkeep o\\nR\\nBlue creatures cannot block creatures you control. Nonblue creatures cannot block creatures you control unless their controller pays an additional 1 life for each blocking creature.', 'Destroy target artifact, land, or enchantment.', "Dormant Volcano comes into play tapped.\\nWhen Dormant Volcano comes into play, return an untapped mountain you control to owner's hand or bury Dormant Volcano.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nR and one colorless mana to your mana pool.", 'Draw a card at the beginning of the upkeep of the turn after Vampirism comes into play.\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each other creature you control. All other creatures you control get -1/-1.', "During each player's draw phase, that player counts the cards in his or her hand, puts those cards on the bottom of his or her library, and then draws that number of cards.", "During each player's upkeep, that player chooses a card at random from his or her hand and sets it aside face up. The player may play that card as though it were in his or her hand. If the player does not play the card by end of turn, bury that card.", "During each player's upkeep, that player sacrifices a creature, or that player loses 5 life and you bury Pillar Tombs of Aku.", 'During this turn and the next one, players cannot declare an attack and cannot play spells or abilities that target any permanent or player.', 'During your draw phase, reveal the first card you draw to all players. If that card is a basic land, draw a card.', 'During your upkeep, for each land target player controls in excess of the number of lands you control, target land he or she controls phases out. Repeat this process for artifacts and then for creatures.', 'Each mana-producing land is a swamp in addition to its normal land type.', 'Each player draws X cards.', 'Each player may play spells and abilities only during his or her turn.', "Each player skips his or her discard phase.\\nDuring each player's draw phase, that player draws an additional card and then chooses and discards a card.", "Each player skips his or her untap phase.\\nAt the beginning of each player's turn, untap each tapped artifact, creature, and land he or she controls and tap each untapped artifact, creature, and land he or she controls.", 'Enchanted creature gains trample.\\nIf all non-Wall creatures you control attack, enchanted creature gets +*/+0 until end of turn, where * is equal to the number of attacking creatures.', 'Enchanted creature gets +1/+1.\\nSacrifice a creature: Regenerate enchanted creature.', "Enchanted creature gets +1/+3.\\noo\\nW Return enchanted creature to owner's hand.", "Everglades comes into play tapped.\\nWhen Everglades comes into play, return an untapped swamp you control to owner's hand or bury Everglades.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nB and one colorless mana to your mana pool.", 'First strike\\nBrass-Talon Chimera counts as a Chimera.\\nSacrifice Brass-Talon Chimera: Put a +2/+2 counter on target Chimera and that Chimera gains first strike permanently.', 'First strike\\nLongbow Archer can block creatures with flying.', 'First strike\\nWhen Nekrataal comes into play, bury target nonartifact, nonblack creature.', 'First strike\\nWhenever Talruum Champion blocks or is blocked by any creature, that creature loses first strike until end of turn.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking is assigned to block this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\nFallen Askari cannot block.', "Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking is assigned to block this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\nSuq'Ata Lancer is unaffected by summoning sickness.", 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking is assigned to block this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\nWhen Knight of the Mists comes into play, pay o\\nU or bury target Knight.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking is assigned to block this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\no1oo\\nW Each creature without flanking blocking Knight of Valor gets -1/-1 until end of turn. Use this ability only once each turn.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking is assigned to block this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\no1oo\\nW Redirect 1 damage from Zhalfirin Crusader to target creature or player.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking is assigned to block this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)\\no\\nUoo\\nU Phase out', 'Flying, phasing', 'Flying, phasing\\nWhen Shimmering Efreet phases in, target creature phases out.', 'Flying, protection from red', 'Flying, trample\\nCumulative upkeep o\\nUo\\nR', 'Flying\\nAttacking does not cause Archangel to tap.', 'Flying\\nAttacking does not cause Tempest Drake to tap.', 'Flying\\nCloud Elemental can block only creatures with flying.', "Flying\\nDuring your upkeep, return an untapped island you control to owner's hand or bury Waterspout Djinn.", 'Flying\\nIf Bogardan Phoenix is put into any graveyard from play and has no death counter on it, return Bogardan Phoenix to play and put a death counter on it.\\nIf Bogardan Phoenix is put into any graveyard from play and has a death counter on it, remove it from the game.', 'Flying\\nSacrifice Daraja Griffin: Destroy target black creature.', 'Flying\\nTin-Wing Chimera counts as a Chimera.\\nSacrifice Tin-Wing Chimera: Put a +2/+2 counter on target Chimera and that Chimera gains flying permanently.', "Flying\\nWhen Shrieking Drake comes into play, return a creature you control to owner's hand.", 'Flying\\no1o\\nB, Sacrifice a creature: Regenerate', 'Flying\\no\\nUo\\nU: Phase out', "Flying\\noc\\nT: If the top card of target player's graveyard is a creature card, put that card on the top of that player's library.", 'Flying\\noo\\nG +0/+1 until end of turn. You cannot spend more than o\\nG in this way each turn.\\nSacrifice Kyscu Drake and Spitting Drake: Search your library for Viashivan Dragon and put it into play. Shuffle your library afterwards.', 'Flying\\noo\\nR +1/+0 until end of turn. You cannot spend more than o\\nR in this way each turn.', 'Flying\\noo\\nR +1/+0 until end of turn\\noo\\nG +0/+1 until end of turn', 'For each 1 damage dealt to Lichenthrope, put a -1/-1 counter on it instead.\\nDuring your upkeep, remove one of these -1/-1 counters from Lichenthrope.', 'Hulking Cyclops cannot block.', 'If Brood of Cockroaches is put into your graveyard from play, pay 1 life and return Brood of Cockroaches to your hand at end of turn.', 'If Dwarven Vigilantes attacks and is not blocked, you may choose to have it deal no combat damage this turn. If you do, Dwarven Vigilantes deals an amount of damage equal to its power to target creature.', 'If Goblin Swine-Rider is blocked, it deals 2 damage to each attacking creature and 2 damage to each blocking creature.', 'If Pygmy Hippo attacks and is not blocked, you may choose to have it deal no combat damage this turn. If you do, defending player draws all mana from his or her lands and then his or her mana pool is emptied. After combat, add an equal amount of colorless mana to your mana pool.', 'If Raging Gorilla blocks or is blocked, it gets +2/-2 until end of turn.', 'If Tar Pit Warrior is the target of a spell or effect, bury Tar Pit Warrior.', 'If damage is dealt to enchanted creature, destroy it.', "If enchanted creature is put into any graveyard, that creature's controller loses an amount of life equal to its power and you gain an amount of life equal to its toughness.", 'Islandwalk (If defending player controls an island, this creature is unblockable.)\\noo\\nG Regenerate', "Jungle Basin comes into play tapped.\\nWhen Jungle Basin comes into play, return an untapped forest you control to owner's hand or bury Jungle Basin.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nG and one colorless mana to your mana pool.", "Karoo comes into play tapped.\\nWhen Karoo comes into play, return an untapped plains you control to owner's hand or bury Karoo.\\noc\\nT: Add o\\nW and one colorless mana to your mana pool.", "Look at target opponent's hand. Choose a card from that player's hand. That player discards that card.", 'Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library. Shuffle your library afterwards.', "Name a card. Put the top card from target opponent's library into his or her graveyard. If that card is the one named, draw a card.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'Ogre Enforcer cannot be destroyed by lethal damage unless a single source deals enough damage to destroy it.', 'Pay 2 life: Search your library for any one card. Shuffle your library, then put that card on top of your library.', 'Phasing\\nCreatures with flying cannot attack, block, or use any ability that includes oc\\nT in the activation cost.', 'Phryexian Marauder comes into play with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\nPhyrexian Marauder cannot block.\\nPhyrexian Marauder cannot attack unless you pay o1 for each +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Play only on a creature an opponent controls.\\nIf enchanted creature becomes tapped, draw a card.', "Prevent all damage to you or target creature from any one source. If that source is red, Honorable Passage deals to the source's controller an amount of damage equal to the amount of damage prevented.", 'Prevent up to 5 damage total to any number of creatures and/or players.', 'Protection from black', 'Put target creature card from your graveyard into play and put a +1/+1 counter on that creature. Treat the creature as though it were just played.', 'Put the top four cards from your library into your graveyard. For each creature card put into your graveyard in this way, all creatures that attack this turn get +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Return Gossamer Chains to owner's hand: Target unblocked creature deals no combat damage this turn.", "Return X swamps you control to owner's hand: Infernal Harvest deals X damage, divided any way you choose, among any number of target creatures.", "Return a forest you control to owner's hand: Untap target creature. Use this ability only once each turn.", 'Return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return two target creatures to owner's hand.", 'Rock Slide deals X damage, divided any way you choose, among any number of target attacking or blocking creatures without flying.', 'Sacrifice Resistance Fighter: Target creature deals no combat damage this turn.', 'Sacrifice a card in play: Target opponent loses 2 life unless he or she sacrifices a permanent or chooses and discards a card.\\nYou may repeat this process as many times as you choose.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Target creature gets +4/+2 until end of turn.', 'Sacrifice a green creature: Search your library for a green creature card and put it into play as though it were just played. Shuffle your library afterwards.', 'Sacrifice a land: Add to your mana pool one mana of any type the sacrificed land could produce. Play this ability as a mana source.', 'Sacrifice all permanents, Discard your hand: Target player loses 5 life.', 'Search your library for a plains card. If you control fewer lands than target opponent, you may search your library for an additional plains card. Reveal those cards to all players and put them into your hand. Shuffle your library afterwards.', 'Simoon deals 1 damage to each creature target opponent controls.', 'Skip your next turn: Chronatog gets +3/+3 until end of turn. Use this ability only once each turn.', "Suq'Ata Assassin cannot be blocked except by artifact or black creatures.\\nIf Suq'Ata Assassin attacks and is not blocked, defending player gets a poison counter. If any player has ten or more poison counters, he or she loses the game.", 'Swampwalk (If defending player controls any swamps, this creature is unblockable.)', 'Take the top three cards from your library, look at them, and set them aside face down. You may play those cards as though they were in your hand. At the beginning of your next turn, bury any of those cards not played.', "Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", "Target player cannot play any land cards this turn. Draw a card at the beginning of the next turn's upkeep.", 'Target player draws two cards.', 'Trample\\nDuring your upkeep, each opponent puts a +1/+1 counter on each creature he or she controls.', 'Trample\\nDuring your upkeep, if you do not control at least one Keeper of Kookus, Kookus deals 3 damage to you and attacks this turn if able.\\noo\\nR +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Trample\\nDuring your upkeep, return a green creature you control to owner's hand.", 'Trample\\nLead-Belly Chimera counts as a Chimera.\\nSacrifice Lead-Belly Chimera: Put a +2/+2 counter on target Chimera and that Chimera gains trample permanently.', 'Tremor deals 1 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Untap all creatures that attacked this turn. You may declare an additional attack during your main phase this turn.', "Viashino Sandstalker is unaffected by summoning sickness.\\nAt the end of any turn, return Viashino Sandstalker to owner's hand.", "When Bull Elephant comes into play, return two forests you control to owner's hand or bury Bull Elephant.", 'When Eye of Singularity comes into play, bury all permanents with the same name except basic lands.\\nWhenever any permanent other than a basic land comes into play, bury any permanent already in play with the same name.', 'When Goblin Recruiter comes into play, search your library for any number of Goblin cards. Reveal those cards to all players. Shuffle your library, then put the cards on top of your library in any order.', "When Man-o'-War comes into play, return target creature to owner's hand.", "When Ovinomancer comes into play, return three basic lands you control to owner's hand or bury Ovinomancer.\\noc\\nT, Return Ovinomancer to owner's hand: Bury target creature and put a Sheep token into play under the control of the creature's controller. Treat this token as a 0/1 green creature.", "When Suleiman's Legacy comes into play, bury all Djinns and Efreets.\\nWhenever a Djinn or Efreet comes into play, bury it.", 'When Uktabi Orangutan comes into play, destroy target artifact.', 'Whenever an enchantment is put into any graveyard from play, draw a card.', 'Whenever any player draws a card, he or she reveals that card. If the card is a creature card, that player pays 3 life or discards the card.', 'You may choose to play King Cheetah whenever you could play an instant.', 'You may choose to play Mystic Veil as an instant; if you do, bury it at end of turn.\\nEnchanted creature cannot be the target of spells or effects.', 'You may choose to play Necromancy as an instant; if you do, bury it at end of turn.\\nWhen you play Necromancy, choose target creature card in any graveyard. When Necromancy comes into play, put that creature into play as though it were just played and Necromancy becomes a creature enchantment that targets the creature. If Necromancy leaves play, bury the creature.', 'You may choose to play Parapet as an instant; if you do, bury it at end of turn.\\nAll creatures you control get +0/+1.', 'You may choose to play Relic Ward as an instant; if you do, bury it at end of turn.\\nEnchanted artifact cannot be the target of spells or effects.', 'You may choose to play Spider Climb as an instant; if you do, bury it at end of turn.\\nEnchanted creature gets +0/+3 and can block creatures with flying.', 'You may play up to three additional lands this turn.', "You may sacrifice two mountains instead of paying Fireblast's casting cost. Fireblast deals 4 damage to target creature or player.", 'o1: Regenerate and put a -1/-1 counter on Matopi Golem.', 'o2, Sacrifice Triangle of War: Choose target creature you control and target creature an opponent controls. Each creature deals an amount of damage equal to its power to the other.', 'o3, oc\\nT: Put a Prism token into play. Treat this token as a 0/1 artifact creature.\\nSacrifice a Prism token: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. Play this ability as a mana source.', "o3, oc\\nT: Target creature you control gets +2/+2 until end of turn. At end of turn, if that creature is in play, return it to owner's hand.", 'o3o\\nBo\\nB, Sacrifice a creature: Put Necrosavant into play. Use this ability only during your upkeep and only if Necrosavant is in your graveyard.', 'o4: Put a pressure counter on Magma Mine.\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice Magam Mine: For each pressure counter on it, Magma Mine deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'o\\nB, Sacrifice Urborg Mindsucker: Target opponent discards a card at random. Play this ability as a sorcery.', 'o\\nG, Sacrifice Giant Caterpillar: Put a Butterfly token into play at end of turn. Treat this token as a 1/1 green creature with flying.', 'o\\nG, oc\\nT: Target land becomes a 2/2 green creature permanently. That land still counts as a land.', "o\\nUo\\nU, Return two islands you control to owner's hand: Return target creature to owner's hand.", 'o\\nUoo\\nU Enchanted creature phases out.', 'o\\nW, Pay 2 life: Prevent all damage to you from any one source.', 'o\\nW, oc\\nT: Target creature cannot block this turn.', 'o\\nX, Sacrifice Snake Basket: Put X Cobra tokens into play. Treat these tokens as 1/1 green creatures. Play this ability as a sorcery.', 'oc\\nT, Sacrifice a land: Destroy target land.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT, Sacrifice Quicksand: Target attacking creature without flying gets -1/-2 until end of turn.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\noc\\nT: Untap target Griffin. That Griffin gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "oc\\nT: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. At the beginning of your next untap phase, return Undiscovered Paradise to owner's hand.", 'oc\\nT: Add two colorless mana to your mana pool. Play this ability as a mana source.', "oc\\nT: Counter target spell unless that spell's caster pays an additional o1 and 1 life. Play this ability as an interrupt.", "oc\\nT: Look at the top card of target player's library. If that card is a nonland card, you may pay 2 life to put it into that player's graveyard.", 'oc\\nT: Target attacking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'oo\\nR Lightning Cloud deals 1 damage to target creature or player. Use this ability only when a red spell is successfully cast and only once for each such spell.', 'oo\\nR Protection from red until end of turn.', 'oo\\nX Crypt Rats deals X damage to each creature and player. Spend only black mana in this way.']
